  "description": "With the Backroad GRX RX810 Di2 you can blast down gravel or dirt roads with full control. The gravel bike is also great at higher speeds on asphalt. Equipped with the first-class, electric SHIMANO GRX RX810 gravel groupset and a double-speed drivetrain, this gravel bike is ideal for longer gravel tours that require smaller gear steps and a wider gear range. Thanks to robust ROSE R THIRTY LIGHT wheels encased in Continental all-round tyres and with a traditional road handlebar, the Backroad can handle lots of kilometres – whether on asphalt, gravel or light trails. More long distance – Endurance Flex is fun – massive comfort in the saddle and a gravity-specific frame fork geometry offers perfect handling on road, gravel and technical terrain. Only a dry throat can stop you. More off-road – Action The frame and fork now allow for a tyre width of up to 45 mm with 700c and up to 47 mm with 650b wheels. For rougher road conditions, perfectly adapted protectors at the down tube and chainstays shield from stone chips. More experience – Adventure Moreover, the Backroad has several mounting points for bottle cages, AnythingCages or bags for the ultimate versatility. * approx. 8.5 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for deepest purple frame, size 57 cm, without pedals *Slight colour and paint deviations possible on frame and fork set",
